  "instance_name": "queen_elizabeth_ii",
  "label": "Queen Elizabeth II",
  "description": "The monarch of the United Kingdom and other Commonwealth realms from 1952 until her death in 2022. She was the mother of King Charles III and reigned for 70 years. Her prolonged life, as referenced in the meme, is the central obstacle to Charles’s ascension, which is why the meme implies frustration. This knowledge is essential to understand the meme’s context — Charles waited 40 years for his mother to die so he could become king.",
